                    <ownedComment xmi:id="25b10a76-c130-4eca-bd68-79af9f119fc1" body="A ObjectStreamClass describes a class that can be serialized to a stream&#xA;or a class that was serialized to a stream.  It contains the name&#xA;and the serialVersionUID of the class.&#xA;&lt;br>&#xA;The ObjectStreamClass for a specific class loaded in this Java VM can&#xA;be found using the lookup method.&#xA;&#xA;@author  Roger Riggs&#xA;@since   JDK1.1&#xA;" annotatedElement="c7039ef2-4c2a-4d74-9a3d-507a88dde460"/>
