                      <ownedComment xmi:id="1e0e1255-0a18-4215-9a09-77e4be04ac5e" body="This interface defines a thread pool execution service.  The ORB uses this&#xA;interface, which preceeds the JDK 5 ExecutorService.  Note that the close&#xA;method must be called in order to reclaim thread resources.&#xA;" annotatedElement="31148375-e447-4b4a-ad54-533832f7977e"/>
