                  <ownedComment xmi:id="277c1aae-6f41-49c1-91ae-d12463d09a7a" body="This class implements the octree quantization method&#xA;as it is described in the &quot;Graphics Gems&quot;&#xA;(ISBN 0-12-286166-3, Chapter 4, pages 297-293)&#xA;" annotatedElement="57b6559c-4e24-48f7-a3b2-2ec1f6f4dca3"/>
