                    <ownedComment xmi:id="1875ce4d-601c-47a7-b92a-5ed81c81fc70" body="A Huffman table within a DHT marker segment.&#xA;" annotatedElement="a2074edc-6ecc-4f7c-a42f-a1a37a015a21"/>
