                      <ownedComment xmi:id="02a4eeb1-16f6-420c-962f-63a674330557" body="BranchHandle is returned by specialized InstructionList.append() whenever a&#xA;BranchInstruction is appended. This is useful when the target of this&#xA;instruction is not known at time of creation and must be set later&#xA;via setTarget().&#xA;&#xA;@see InstructionHandle&#xA;@see Instruction&#xA;@see InstructionList&#xA;@author  &lt;A HREF=&quot;mailto:markus.dahm@berlin.de&quot;>M. Dahm&lt;/A>&#xA;" annotatedElement="3e95755d-d9fa-4beb-9f4f-f73394df8b09"/>
