                      <ownedComment xmi:id="9122b9e8-cf1b-4a1c-ba17-6202ab2673a4" body="INVOKESPECIAL - Invoke instance method; special handling for superclass, private&#xA;and instance initialization method invocations&#xA;&#xA;&lt;PRE>Stack: ..., objectref, [arg1, [arg2 ...]] -&amp;gt; ...&lt;/PRE>&#xA;&#xA;@author  &lt;A HREF=&quot;mailto:markus.dahm@berlin.de&quot;>M. Dahm&lt;/A>&#xA;" annotatedElement="40e2b923-2166-4037-b1ae-95caad742a56"/>
