                      <ownedComment xmi:id="559c2e08-6568-4a80-8755-1039769e9eac" body="INVOKESTATIC - Invoke a class (static) method&#xA;&#xA;&lt;PRE>Stack: ..., [arg1, [arg2 ...]] -&amp;gt; ...&lt;/PRE>&#xA;&#xA;@author  &lt;A HREF=&quot;mailto:markus.dahm@berlin.de&quot;>M. Dahm&lt;/A>&#xA;" annotatedElement="e4ec7c20-fa85-4094-8279-a172a8fafabd"/>
