                      <ownedComment xmi:id="5cc15ba8-37cd-463d-a6bf-a36170037dd7" body="INVOKEVIRTUAL - Invoke instance method; dispatch based on class&#xA;&#xA;&lt;PRE>Stack: ..., objectref, [arg1, [arg2 ...]] -&amp;gt; ...&lt;/PRE>&#xA;&#xA;@author  &lt;A HREF=&quot;mailto:markus.dahm@berlin.de&quot;>M. Dahm&lt;/A>&#xA;" annotatedElement="21a37256-9a11-4434-83bc-f2684f880ac2"/>
