                      <ownedComment xmi:id="81a9f61d-5814-46ab-b27e-279476e41f3f" body="Denotes an unparameterized instruction to store a value into a local variable,&#xA;e.g. ISTORE.&#xA;&#xA;@author  &lt;A HREF=&quot;mailto:markus.dahm@berlin.de&quot;>M. Dahm&lt;/A>&#xA;" annotatedElement="8ea76694-ef04-4b00-bf64-027b97e52f87"/>
