                      <ownedComment xmi:id="99fff470-5f01-4d6d-bc8b-c45fb4666a98" body="This is the base class of all SAX parsers. It implements both the&#xA;SAX1 and SAX2 parser functionality, while the actual pipeline is&#xA;defined in the parser configuration.&#xA;&#xA;@author Arnaud Le Hors, IBM&#xA;@author Andy Clark, IBM&#xA;&#xA;@version $Id: AbstractSAXParser.java,v 1.6 2010-11-01 04:40:09 joehw Exp $&#xA;" annotatedElement="c9ed7626-1f37-4b60-88a0-f963ec5bef46"/>
