                        <ownedComment xmi:id="0ebd6357-4db6-4c10-8176-78379debef9b" body="This class is extremely useful for loading resources and classes in a fault&#xA;tolerant manner that works across different applications servers. Do not&#xA;touch this unless you're a grizzled classloading guru veteran who is going to&#xA;verify any change on 6 different application servers.&#xA;" annotatedElement="177007c7-57d6-4a1d-b27c-4bc7b873f758"/>
