              <ownedComment xmi:id="8717eb0e-8e2e-4a16-b0dc-433ea65020c7" body="The &lt;code>CubicCurve2D&lt;/code> class defines a cubic parametric curve&#xA;segment in {@code (x,y)} coordinate space.&#xA;&lt;p>&#xA;This class is only the abstract superclass for all objects which&#xA;store a 2D cubic curve segment.&#xA;The actual storage representation of the coordinates is left to&#xA;the subclass.&#xA;&#xA;@author      Jim Graham&#xA;@since 1.2&#xA;" annotatedElement="35803e57-8052-4c15-8efa-09d3245033b0"/>
