                <ownedComment xmi:id="ed874a86-52c5-4ce3-a569-55caf9612874" body="A function that maps an array of interfaces to an optimal key where&#xA;Class objects representing interfaces are weakly referenced.&#xA;" annotatedElement="38928132-59a0-4d8c-8928-39b9cf5b7966"/>
