                <ownedComment xmi:id="fd9ab046-9a97-4886-94d7-14e0d75654f8" body="We need this class in addition to UnmodifiableSet as&#xA;Map.Entries themselves permit modification of the backing Map&#xA;via their setValue operation.  This class is subtle: there are&#xA;many possible attacks that must be thwarted.&#xA;&#xA;@serial include&#xA;" annotatedElement="b8c9edf9-1444-4769-a3cf-949f0277bf57"/>
