              <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:Class" xmi:id="5611a200-4911-44bb-a103-5be0aa694428" name="DerivedColor" visibility="package">
                <ownedComment xmi:id="1dc97c62-a9b2-4406-a4ad-c0d514a37508" body="DerivedColor - A color implementation that is derived from a UIManager&#xA;defaults table color and a set of offsets. It can be rederived at any point&#xA;by calling rederiveColor(). For example when its parent color changes and it&#xA;value will update to reflect the new derived color. Property change events&#xA;are fired for the &quot;rgb&quot; property when the derived color changes.&#xA;&#xA;@author Jasper Potts&#xA;" annotatedElement="5611a200-4911-44bb-a103-5be0aa694428"/>
