                  <ownedComment xmi:id="e6fcc70c-0a70-4a02-99c5-e514e3d8265d" body="IndexedSegment extends Segment adding the offset into the&#xA;the model the &lt;code>Segment&lt;/code> was asked for.&#xA;" annotatedElement="5bb3d4e4-6153-4c44-8bb1-f5801f755bc9"/>
