              <ownedComment xmi:id="86500e29-d801-4be0-a119-9e1edde29dd1" body="ModelChange is used when sorting to restore state, it corresponds&#xA;to data from a TableModelEvent.  The values are precalculated as&#xA;they are used extensively.&#xA;" annotatedElement="bb681fd6-f3b5-43f3-80fc-a1e24c8c3bfd"/>
            </nestedClassifier>
