              <ownedComment xmi:id="8fb8087d-49a5-4a79-8c33-9f08afe8b7b6" body="The Holder for &lt;tt>Current&lt;/tt>.  For more information on&#xA;Holder files, see &lt;a href=&quot;doc-files/generatedfiles.html#holder&quot;>&#xA;&quot;Generated Files: Holder Files&quot;&lt;/a>.&lt;P>&#xA;org/omg/CORBA/CurrentHolder.java&#xA;Generated by the IDL-to-Java compiler (portable), version &quot;3.0&quot;&#xA;from ../../../../../src/share/classes/org/omg/PortableServer/corba.idl&#xA;Saturday, July 17, 1999 12:26:21 AM PDT&#xA;" annotatedElement="6705bb85-aece-4bb1-81ce-555befe4e691"/>
