              <ownedComment xmi:id="daea366d-61f5-453e-b009-4fb352dc936c" body="The Holder for &lt;tt>DoubleSeq&lt;/tt>.  For more information on&#xA;Holder files, see &lt;a href=&quot;doc-files/generatedfiles.html#holder&quot;>&#xA;&quot;Generated Files: Holder Files&quot;&lt;/a>.&lt;P>&#xA;org/omg/CORBA/DoubleSeqHolder.java&#xA;Generated by the IDL-to-Java compiler (portable), version &quot;3.0&quot;&#xA;from streams.idl&#xA;13 May 1999 22:41:37 o'clock GMT+00:00&#xA;" annotatedElement="83569675-3e6f-4a6a-9b9a-67049e271910"/>
