              <ownedComment xmi:id="99689e72-3d78-4072-af15-5e93e6477f6e" body="Enumeration of parameter modes for Parameter.  Possible vaues:&#xA;&lt;ul>&#xA;&lt;li>PARAM_IN - Represents an &quot;in&quot; parameter.&lt;/li>&#xA;&lt;li>PARAM_OUT - Represents an &quot;out&quot; parameter.&lt;/li>&#xA;&lt;li>PARAM_INOUT - Represents an &quot;inout&quot; parameter.&lt;/li>&#xA;&lt;/ul>&#xA;" annotatedElement="a3280e35-215e-4140-9d36-a1b165c464e1"/>
